Z||000001||deceler8||11-23-2000||10:28 AM||||The solar chargers are mainly used to maintain a battery's charge. A solar charger large enough to actually charge a battery in a reasonable amount of time would be pretty expensive. <P>The maintenance solar chargers are pretty cheap for the most part. Only takes about 500 milliamps/hour to maintain charge.||||reg||1
